ck_id":"LRNJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf8c993c-4375-4682-be26-b03fd971c685","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"リー群、到達前に卒業してしまった","ts":"1625924470.217600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2UKT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3abdd4b-dd73-4cbe-86d8-abb969932863","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"リー群手を付けたこと無いけど、難しそうな印象があります","ts":"1625924425.216100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VmC2I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"700e8b47-466c-4950-8398-55dc3a7cc5e2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"この手の群とかで、めだかさんとかすずめさんとかが発見したのが定着したらおもしろくなりすぎちゃうな...","ts":"1625924382.215700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O/cyS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b1ab970-3076-4d59-aeab-d8bd12b2228f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とりあえず↑の疑問は解消しました\nありがとうございます","ts":"1625924371.215500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RVpl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"add54198-3d54-44be-b6a4-7475229f7022","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"先々週にリー群の勉強して同型とか準同型の話わからんなあと思い","ts":"1625924280.214200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7gn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e76640bb-26a1-421b-8a98-c8935a8ebe00","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"それ読んでる","ts":"1625924245.212900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N4i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fad65f3-aa2e-4973-8aa0-cca6a739f946","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"志賀位相30講を先週買ったんですよ","ts":"1625924243.212700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":2,"users":["UG6DF6W87","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=rwMp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5544ca58-ee61-4315-87bb-238bb26810bd","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"円周にいつまでも到達できないお気持ちの表現ですね \u0026gt; 有限開被覆をとれない開被覆","ts":"1625924205.212000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O0Z0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3A8CA921-C39D-4E81-BA63-13F4B89B8326","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"R^2 に密着位相入れたくなってきた","ts":"1625924111.210500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R2a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58eb39d9-01a1-4a39-8ae9-d7a8d8740a8e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"A_n = {(x, y) | x^2+y^2 \u0026lt; 1 - 1/n}\nで {A_n | n は自然数} 、っていう感じで構成される集合族は結構よく出てくる印象があるんですが、こういうときに使うんですねえ","ts":"1625924108.210200","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625924118.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MvhBw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6477a41-19c9-475a-b4ef-beb38c1ee224","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ぜんぜんついてけないけど、そういえば今日はこれ買って読んだ\n\u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4274065707/\u003e\nちょっとは勉強できた気がする","ts":"1625924079.208800","attachments":[{"fallback":"マンガでわかる統計学","id":1,"title":"マンガでわかる統計学","title_link":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4274065707/","text":"マンガでわかる統計学","image_url":"https://images-fe.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51EFK1XNQ5L._SR600%2c315_PIWhiteStrip%2cBottomLeft%2c0%2c35_PIStarRatingFOUR%2cBottomLeft%2c360%2c-6_SR600%2c315_ZA171%2c445%2c290%2c400%2c400%2cAmazonEmberBold%2c12%2c4%2c0%2c0%2c5_SCLZZZZZZZ_FMpng_BG255%2c255%2c255.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"amazon.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4274065707/","original_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/4274065707/"}],"edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1625924092.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":4,"users":["UG6DF6W87","UL6CFN8NR","U01D9BALEKU","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oYz"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"この言明のうち「任意の」という部分が重要なんですね。実際、リンク先の PDF でも強調されている。\n単に有限開被覆が取れるよ、というのがコンパクト集合の定義ではない。「どんな開被覆も、そこから有限個の開集合を選んで有限開被覆に落とし込めるよ」、ということが大事だったんですね。","ts":"1625924021.206800","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[July 10th, 2021 10:25 PM] mogassy: コンパクト集合の定義は正確にはこうです：\n\u0026gt; A の任意の開被覆 {Uλ | λ ∈ Λ} ⊂ O に対してある有限個の Λ の元 λ1, . . . , λK が存在して、{Uλ1 , . . . , UλK } が A の開被覆となる場合を言う。\n\u003chttps://www.math.nagoya-u.ac.jp/~yanagida/16W/yanagida-2W16-12.pdf\u003e","author_id":"UL6CFN8NR","author_name":"monaqa","author_subname":"monaqa","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UL6CFN8NR","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2019-07-28/696621453314_0edf66561724b8e38e6a_48.png","text":"コンパクト集合の定義は正確にはこうです：\n\u0026gt; A の任意の開被覆 {Uλ | λ ∈ Λ} ⊂ O に対してある有限個の Λ の元 λ1, . . . , λK が存在して、{Uλ1 , . . . , UλK } が A の開被覆となる場合を言う。\n\u003chttps://www.math.nagoya-u.ac.jp/~yanagida/16W/yanagida-2W16-12.pdf\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-science","ts":1625923514.197800,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01844Y1FD2/p1625923514197800"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NNh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be1d1b48-30f2-48d0-9d62-8a9d8e9196e0","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"より正確に表現すれば、同じ開集合からなる被覆は開被覆になります","ts":"1625923916.205900","thread_ts":"1625923833.205200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BZEDZ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"9028dc95-a557-437e-86dd-00b8150ed5f5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"開被覆の各元は同じでもよいです","ts":"1625923833.205200","thread_ts":"1625923833.205200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sDwG"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"67f4a9b0-0d0c-434b-af26-1fa3a094d144","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なんかコンパクトに対する理解が少し深まった気がする。集合と位相の勉強やり直そうかなあ","ts":"1625923838.205400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YOQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9028dc95-a557-437e-86dd-00b8150ed5f5","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"開被覆の各元は同じでもよいです","ts":"1625923833.205200","thread_ts":"1625923833.205200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sDwG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee406b06-f96f-4dc1-9fa4-73b0c409aa12","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"これは怪しい表現で\n有限開被覆をとれない開被覆が存在すれば、ですね","ts":"1625923775.203700","thread_ts":"1625923618.201200","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h1cB"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"7029bafe-8b12-4a93-9c5d-1b68e73a6090","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"すべての開被覆について、有限開被覆をとれないなら非コンパクトか","ts":"1625923618.201200","thread_ts":"1625923618.201200","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YwG"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"3d1873db-1f33-4929-8fd7-bdd73769796f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"内から外へ円広げていけば、って書いてたら回答でてた","ts":"1625923681.203300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ai6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"576833c9-60ef-4242-a4e6-94b54ea2a1aa","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"これって開被覆の各元が同じでないことを仮定しているようにみえますがあってますか？","ts":"1625923679.203000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/sV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d61148a6-2eb6-4942-be6c-928261c2a5cc","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際そういう開被覆は B にも存在して、\nx^2+y^2 \u0026lt; 1 - 1/n (n は自然数)\nという集合は開被覆になりますが、どんなふうに有限個選んだって B を覆うことはできません","ts":"1625923621.201300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625923681.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0UGb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7029bafe-8b12-4a93-9c5d-1b68e73a6090","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"すべての開被覆について、有限開被覆をとれないなら非コンパクトか","ts":"1625923618.201200","thread_ts":"1625923618.201200","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YwG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fe77575-4d12-4ca7-a2e3-536905fca000","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"したがって、「開被覆のとりかたによっては、そのうちどんな有限個の元を選んでも開被覆にならないよ〜」って例を持ってくれば、コンパクトでないことの証明になるわけです","ts":"1625923558.198700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625923742.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+7R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c3a470e-029e-455d-9358-aee703f575cc","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"コンパクト集合の定義は正確にはこうです：\n\u0026gt; A の任意の開被覆 {Uλ | λ ∈ Λ} ⊂ O に対してある有限個の Λ の元 λ1, . . . , λK が存在して、{Uλ1 , . . . , UλK } が A の開被覆となる場合を言う。\n\u003chttps://www.math.nagoya-u.ac.jp/~yanagida/16W/yanagida-2W16-12.pdf\u003e","ts":"1625923514.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W1H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5da02f02-5c98-4efe-828b-7f9d11fb3b3f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"湯船は本当に考え事に向いている","ts":"1625923485.197400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"67o5b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f730034f-f71b-4bc3-9bd9-19fbed0d68cc","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"いまお風呂の中で考えてたんですが、その理由わかりました","ts":"1625923469.197200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dn2o5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dd0c859-d855-4728-b189-031eb36e861c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"コンパクトシティ(数学)","ts":"1625923436.196700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e3R="}]},{"client_msg_id":"5347b5f2-7ab9-4d6d-b1ea-88b0927843a0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そのものをとるのが不自然なら半月ずつ割って重ねるような開集合族を考えても同じくダメなはずですが","ts":"1625923258.196400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E6Rr0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"773a2494-ca8c-4aa2-8789-ea4e13736f7c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"を考えたときに開集合族としてそのもののみを含むものO_i={B} を考えるのはなぜダメなのかってことです","ts":"1625923164.195400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xn8gp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e9a18be-bfe5-4db2-9fd0-85113f32100b","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あ、そちらで理解したいってことですね","ts":"1625923146.194900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PHie"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3e82102-de52-4d07-b013-6ea262bd7884","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"有限開被覆をもつ \u0026lt;=\u0026gt; コンパクト","ts":"1625923103.193800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ibG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2690bb46-d1d6-4777-a89d-7b4146f497eb","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あーそのへんの同値な条件は納得できるんですが","ts":"1625923070.193300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iLB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9def6307-27d7-4962-969f-597cf650178c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"距離空間なので点列コンパクトと同値になる\nで、円周へ向かう B 内の点列を考えるとこれが収束する部分列を持たない","ts":"1625923048.192900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XaW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5507fd3f-b0ad-4ef0-aa64-8a8ba4cc53c6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"コンパクト、懐かしい\n点列コンパクトの性質は満たして無さそうですよねー開集合なので","ts":"1625923041.192700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eTOmt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78b6a2da-391b-4df8-974f-89de2f3905a9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"R^2が非コンパクトでR^2とBが同相だから、これはわかる","ts":"1625922127.189200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p7Bvb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c3a7c3b-71d3-4bcb-a84f-22e33921ad65","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"単位円内部 B={(x,y)| x^2+y^2\u0026lt;1} が非コンパクトなのなんででしたっけ\nO_i = {B} としたらこれが有限開被覆としてはいけないの、なぜだろう。。。","ts":"1625922088.188600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ebb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73112987-bef8-4983-b89a-6c88cc42e973","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"2行読むのに1日かかったりしますからね...\n// 1日で済めばいいけど","ts":"1625889566.186500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"72Z8w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18fcb850-a69f-4ee0-83b4-f1fc723c71d4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なんなら戻ることありますからね","ts":"1625880319.183600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e5c4436-7fd0-4bc7-bb04-fd9a47776f76","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"タイムマシンだ","ts":"1625880296.183300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fkc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b82d50a-7c3f-4c92-8be9-746b9a4fc60a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"2ページくらい読んで気がついたら3時間くらい経ってる　おかしい…","ts":"1625852101.183000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SdSy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e3270cc-c8de-4441-a0d6-d565387b4947","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"分厚い数学書は途中で力尽きるけど、薄い数学書は書いてないことに思いを馳せてこれも成り立つんじゃね？とか考えだすのでこっちはこっちで力尽きる","ts":"1625852013.182200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nEBC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21467050-bdfb-4f8d-ae19-469799b65708","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"数学徒だったら数学書読むときにそうはならんやろってならなさそうで羨ましい","ts":"1625848328.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kQI5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"420b3ce2-f9a1-4a3b-a3bc-9f56bba4879c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"量子力学を使うんですけど、古典も分かってねえなあと思うことが最近よくあった＆もともと読んでみたいと思ってたので","ts":"1625847188.178800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U022TD5GGKE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yHf="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f8828a7-e290-4740-960b-dfe7563eff69","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"結局難しいことしたかったら数理物理的な腕力がいるんですよね","ts":"1625847109.177300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Xqw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"403dfd2e-5148-410d-9b66-c5aa51d7cf3a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"応用物理系ですね","ts":"1625847070.176400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U022TD5GGKE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ullr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"375e7f25-7a91-4b5e-8f1a-b63c0d67d880","type":"message","user":"U022TD5GGKE","text":"Mizunoさんは数学徒なんでしたっけ？解析力学にどうして興味を持ったのかが気になりました。","ts":"1625846140.175000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/oHGt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f14d58e-0f51-4f1e-bd57-a8cc871b6fb8","type":"message","